        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4410, Two Piece Saratoga Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Two Piece Saratoga Entry Door Lockset has an oval shape that is as elegant as it is timeless. This tubular front door handleset is a great way to add a traditional touch to your home, with all the classic beauty that goes along with it. This Oval Saratoga Handleset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions and comes as a complete set, packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a standard 2-1/8 inch prepped door. The Saratoga Entrance Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from a huge selection of interior knobs and levers in a wide selection of some of the most stunning finishes in the industry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Oval Saratoga Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Saratoga Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Rose Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-7/16\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4410-specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>Emtek 4410 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-C-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4311-finish.jpg?v=1704354609\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Saratoga Handleset",
                "description": "The Two Piece Saratoga Entry Door Lockset has an oval shape that is as elegant as it is timeless. This tubular front door handleset is a great way to add a traditional touch to your home, with all the classic beauty that goes along with it. This Oval Saratoga Handleset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions and comes as a complete set, packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a standard 2-1/8 inch prepped door. The Saratoga Entrance Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from a huge selection of interior knobs and levers in a wide selection of some of the most stunning finishes in the industry.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Emtek Saratoga Entry Door Handlesets, Saratoga Handlesets, Emtek 4410, Emtek 4400, Emtek 4420, traditional handlesets, oval handlesets, Emtek Saratoga Entrance Handlesets,  Oval Saratoga Tubular Handleset, two piece Oval handlesets, Two Piece Saratoga Entry Door Locksets,"
